## Quickstart

```turtle
<subject> a gmeow:DoxasticState ;
    gmeow:credence "..." ;  # xsd:decimal
    gmeow:doxasticClaim <...> ;  # gmeow:StandpointClaim
    gmeow:doxasticContent <...> ;  # gmeow:Proposition
    gmeow:epistemicAgent <...> .  # gmeow:Agent
```

